== 1) dapr list
APP ID     HTTP PORT  GRPC PORT  APP PORT  COMMAND               AGE  CREATED              DAPRD PID  CLI PID  APP PID  
inventory  3501       50002      8081      python3 /tmp/svc....  23s  2026-11-22 16:31.11  230839     230817   230840   
order      3500       50001      8080      python3 /tmp/svc....  23s  2026-11-22 16:31.11  230845     230818   230846   
== 2) 组件（默认 statestore 指向 localhost:6379）
apiVersion: dapr.io/v1alpha1
kind: Component
metadata:
  name: statestore
spec:
  type: state.redis
  version: v1
  metadata:
  - name: redisHost
    value: localhost:6379
  - name: redisPassword
    value: ""
  - name: actorStateStore
    value: "true"
== 3) state API: 写读删
save_http=204
get: {"n":1,"s":"bar"}
delete_http=204
get_after_delete_http=204
== 4) service invocation: order -> inventory（经 sidecar）
{"service": "inventory", "path": "/reserve"}
invoke_http=200
== 5) metadata
app_id: order | runtime: 1.19.2 | components: ['pubsub', 'statestore']
== 6) 可退：停 order sidecar
✅  app stopped successfully: order
order sidecar 端口状态: 000
connection refused
== 7) inventory 仍在
inventory_metadata_http=200
== 8) 运行中的容器
dapr_placement daprio/dapr:1.19.2
dapr_scheduler daprio/dapr:1.19.2
dapr_zipkin openzipkin/zipkin
dapr_redis redis:6
